###     API for add Users
POst http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username" : "Varun",
    "email" : "varun@gmail.com",
    "password" : "varun@123"
}

### API for Generate Token
POst http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username" : "Anu",
    "password" : "anu@123"
}


###  List the Notes Using Tokens
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429

### Add Notes 
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429

{
    "title" : "Introduction to Python",
    "description" : "Basic python programs such as Datatypes,looping statements and oop concepts.."
}

### Get a single Note
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/1/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429

### update notes
PUT   http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429

{
    "title" : "Introduction Databases",
    "description" : "Insertion,deletion and updation  operations using SQL Queries.."
}

### Delete Notes
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/notes/1/
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429


### Logout Token
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/logout/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 6b981172d1467f7edfcd2b934652cd2bd8785429

### API for JWT login
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt_login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username" : "Varun",
    "password" : "varun@123"
}

